WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
Insulating your loft? How thick should it be, how many rolls do you need, and what will it cost?

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:08.367
Enter the size of your loft,

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.767
add what's already up there,

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:15.533
and choose your target.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.233
You instantly see the depth to add, how many rolls to buy, and the cost.

00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:26.067
It's free, there's no sign-up, and it's based on the Building Regulations.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.833
Try it free at loftinsulationcalc.com.
